  article
    header
      h1
        a(href='../2020/deutscher-kindertheaterpreis-2020/') Deutscher Kindertheaterpreis 2020
      time(pubdate) November 12, 2020
    p
      a(href='https://pauldillmusic.com/' rel='noopener' target='_blank') Paul Dill
      |  and I composed music for the 
      em Deutscher Kindertheaterpreis
      |  2020 (German Children’s Theatre Prize).
    .embed-container
      iframe(src='https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/videoseries?list=PL3l39lfx_UJ2SpQjJV5QtciFbjV1K6zqE&rel=0&loop=1' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen).


    p
      | I produced the recordings, 
      a(href='http://irenecortina.com/' rel='noopener' target='_blank') Irene Cortina
      |  created video, 
      a(href='https://www.lydia-dimitrow.de/' rel='noopener' target='_blank') Lydia Dimitrow
      |  acted as dramaturg and Charlotte Birkenhauer played Vibraphone.
    p
      | The pieces shortlisted for the prizes were:
      br
      | – „Rishi“ by Kees Roorda
      br
      | – „Freie Wahl“ by Esther Rölz
      br
      | – „Absprung“ by Rabiah Hussain
      br
      | – „Liebe Grüße … oder Wohin das Leben fällt“ by Theo Fransz
      br
      | – „Wer nicht träumt, ist selbst ein Traum“ by Jens Raschke
      br
      | – „Wutschweiger“ by Jan Sobrie und Raven Ruëll
    p Additionally „Bis sie verschwinden im reifen Weizen“ by Katharina Kern, „Kill Baby“ by Ivana Sokola and „Aschewolken“ by Lisa Wentz were given special mention.
    p
      | This prizes were awarded by the 
      a(href='https://www.kjtz.de/' rel='noopener' target='_blank') Kinder- und Jugendtheaterzentrum in der Bundesrepublik Deutschland (KJTZ)
      |  and the 
      a(href='https://www.assitej.de/' rel='noopener' target='_blank') deutsche Vertretung der Internationalen Vereinigung des Theaters für Kinder und Jugendliche (ASSITEJ e.V. Deutschland)
      | .
  article
    header
      h1
        a(href='../2018/scoring-for-das-apartment-season-two/') Scoring for Das Apartment, season two
      time(pubdate) October 3, 2018
    p
      | I worked on original music for the second season of 
      a(href='https://www.facebook.com/webisodeberlin/' rel='noopener' target='_blank') Das Apartment
      | :
    .embed-container
      iframe(src='https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/vTXzRwHVGaw?rel=0' frameborder='0' allowfullscreen).


    p
      | It’s a “Comedy-Webisode” created by 
      a(href='http://grainofsalt.eu/' rel='noopener' target='_blank') Reinaldo Almeida
      |  and a lot friends from the 
      a(href='https://www.comedycafeberlin.com/' rel='noopener' target='_blank') Berlin-expat Comedy Scene
      | . Also my brother 
      a(href='http://jolyon-auri.tumblr.com/' rel='noopener' target='_blank') Jolyon Auri
      |  worked on props, designed the sets, and created a bunch of artworks that appear throughout!
    p
      | The season was released on 3/10/2018 and is currently available via 
      a(href='https://vimeo.com/ondemand/dasapartment' rel='noopener' target='_blank') Vimeo On Demand
      |  and 
      a(href='https://www.pantaflix.com/en/s/759365/2' rel='noopener' target='_blank') Pantaflix
      | .
  article
    header
      h1
        a(href='../2018/monster-mouse-ep-your-friend-204/')
          span Monster Mouse EP:
          |  Your Friend #204
      time(pubdate) May 18, 2018
    p Your Friend #204 consists of 4 songs packed with sounds and effects that will make your brain pop and your booty wiggle. While most Berliners were tucked into their cosy beds this winter, Monster Mouse boys Leo Auri, Nico Lengauer, and Jonathan Reiter were in the studio recording their first EP, a thoughtful experimentation with the boundaries of 2018 pop music.
    p
      iframe(style='border: 0; width: 100%; height: calc(95vw + 217px); max-height: 1000px;' src='https://bandcamp.com/EmbeddedPlayer/album=2424524711/size=large/bgcol=ffffff/linkcol=EE3D00/transparent=true/' seamless).

        <a href="http://monstermouse.bandcamp.com/album/your-friend-204">
        Your Friend #204 by Monster Mouse</a>

    p
      | Find the EP on 
      a(href='https://monstermouse.bandcamp.com/album/your-friend-204' rel='noopener' target='_blank') bandcamp
      |  and 
      a(href='https://open.spotify.com/album/5LaE8pyh9PzH1vRAKd01PF' rel='noopener' target='_blank') spotify
      | .
      br
      | Find Monster Mouse on 
      a(href='https://www.facebook.com/monstermousemusic/' rel='noopener' target='_blank') facebook
      | .
    p
